{"ticker":"D","updated":"2026-11-13T23:05:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Dominion Energy, Inc.","shortName":"Dominion Energy, Inc.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dominionenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":15200,"marketCap":59511443456,"trailingPE":22.330034,"forwardPE":17.715706,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0981019,"pegRatio":2.65,"targetMeanPrice":70.16667,"targetHighPrice":87.0,"targetLowPrice":62.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.241,"earningsGrowth":0.12,"grossMargins":0.46508998,"operatingMargins":0.31225002,"profitMargins":0.13993,"totalRevenue":19209000960,"beta":0.59,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":72.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":55.85,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.96},"summary":"Dominion Energy, Inc. provides regulated electricity and natural gas services in the United States. It operates through Dominion Energy Virginia, Dominion Energy South Carolina, and Contracted Energy segments. The Dominion Energy Virginia segment engages in the generation, distribution, and transmission of electricity to approximately 2.8 million residential, commercial, industrial, and governmental customers in Virginia and North Carolina. The Dominion Energy South Carolina segment generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.8 million customers in the central, southern, and southwestern portions of South Carolina; and distributes natural gas to approximately 0.5 million residential, commercial, and industrial customers in South Carolina. The Contracted Energy segment is involved in the nonregulated long-term contracted renewable electric generation fleet and renewable natural gas facilities. As of December 31, 2025, the company's portfolio of assets included approximately 30.7 GW of electric generating capacity, 10,800 miles of electric transmission lines, and 80,400 miles of electric distribution lines. The company was formerly known as Dominion Resources, Inc. Dominion Energy, Inc. was incorporated in 1983 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","summary_zh":"Dominion Energy, Inc. 在美國提供受監管的電力和天然氣服務。它透過Dominion Energy Virginia、Dominion Energy South Carolina和合約能源部門運作。 Dominion Energy Virginia 部門為維吉尼亞州和北卡羅來納州約 280 萬住宅、商業、工業和政府客戶提供電力生產、配電和傳輸服務。 Dominion Energy South Carolina 部門為南卡羅來納州中部、南部和西南部的約 80 萬客戶提供電力生產、輸電和配電服務；向南卡羅來納州約 50 萬住宅、商業和工業客戶供應天然氣。合約能源部門涉及不受監管的長期合約再生發電車隊和可再生天然氣設施。截至2025年12月31日，該公司的資產組合包括約30.7吉瓦的發電量、10,800英里的輸電線路和80,400英里的配電線路。該公司前身為 Dominion Resources, Inc.。 Dominion Energy, Inc. 成立於 1983 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州里士滿。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":60.05,"h":60.75,"l":60.0,"c":60.58,"v":6002400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":60.43,"h":60.55,"l":59.36,"c":59.4,"v":4550900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":59.63,"h":59.98,"l":59.45,"c":59.6,"v":3492100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":59.14,"h":60.12,"l":58.8,"c":59.74,"v":4527500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":60.04,"h":60.19,"l":59.3,"c":59.85,"v":9145900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":59.92,"h":60.29,"l":59.08,"c":59.82,"v":6387100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":59.75,"h":61.21,"l":59.65,"c":61.12,"v":4318500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":61.08,"h":61.52,"l":60.88,"c":61.02,"v":4464100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":61.08,"h":61.12,"l":59.57,"c":59.67,"v":4096700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":60.01,"h":60.43,"l":59.7,"c":60.33,"v":3114400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":60.57,"h":61.07,"l":60.35,"c":60.92,"v":3467200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":61.03,"h":61.21,"l":60.74,"c":61.17,"v":2829400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":61.31,"h":61.75,"l":60.89,"c":60.9,"v":3635200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":60.59,"h":61.58,"l":60.59,"c":61.09,"v":3583700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":61.16,"h":62.05,"l":61.16,"c":61.53,"v":4021900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":61.63,"h":61.78,"l":61.03,"c":61.5,"v":5905300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":62.0,"h":62.37,"l":60.79,"c":60.87,"v":9524000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":61.23,"h":61.25,"l":60.11,"c":60.57,"v":5312300},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":60.85,"h":61.23,"l":60.02,"c